        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Chronicles 20:20",
        "book": "2 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "And when he had consulted with the people, he appointed singers unto the Lord, and that should praise the beauty of holiness, as they went out before the army, and to say, Praise the Lord; for his mercy endureth for ever.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 203,
            "end": 211
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Chronicles 20:21",
        "book": "2 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "And when they began to sing and to praise, the Lord set ambushments against the children of Ammon, Moab, and mount Seir, which were come against Judah; and they were smitten.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 161,
            "end": 173,
            "text": "OR smote one another."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Chronicles 20:22",
        "book": "2 Chronicles",
        "chapter": 20,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "For the children of Ammon and Moab stood up against the inhabitants of mount Seir, utterly to slay and destroy them: and when they had made an end of the inhabitants of Seir, every one helped to destroy another.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 203,
            "end": 210,
            "text": "Judg. 7:22; 1 Sam. 14:20."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 111,
            "end": 116
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Judg. 7:22; 1 Sam. 14:20.",
            "prettyString": "Judges 7:22; 1 Samuel 14:20",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "judges",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 7,
                    "end": 7,
